             Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

Students, faculty, and staff may obtain a Sun Card by visiting one of our four campus locations. Please click  <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/cardservices#locations" target="_blank">here</a> for locations and hours of operation. <i>Hours are reduced during breaks and during the summer semester.</i><br /><br />

<b>Sun Cards cost $25.00</b> and can be purchased with cash, Visa /Mastercard, or be billed to your ASU Student Account. <i>Cash is only accepted at the Tempe location. </i><br /><br />

You will need to have your <b>student ID number</b> and a <b>government issued ID</b> available when you visit our office. <i>Government issued ID may include: US drivers license, US passport, US visa.</i>


<br /><br />
Regards,<br />
 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
